---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Career Opportunities" description="Support connecting with partner restaurants and hotels.">
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-20">
    <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-[var(--color-accent)]">Career</p>
    <h1 class="mt-3 font-[family-name:var(--font-display)] text-4xl">After the Academy</h1>


    <div class="markdown-body mt-10">
      <p>
        Graduates of our longer programs continue into a period of supervised practical
        training, where technique becomes speed and consistency. The instructor selects the
        best student or students of each group, who will be offered a job at our sister
        restaurant, <a href="https://manna-restaurants.de" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Manna Sushi &amp; Grill</a>.
        There is no guarantee of a position. Other graduates may receive support in connecting with partner restaurants and hotels
        that are hiring.
      </p>

      <blockquote>
        <strong>Important.</strong> Visas, residence permits and employment authorization are
        decided solely by the relevant German authorities. Global Sushi Academy does not
        guarantee visa approval, and enrollment in a course does not by itself guarantee
        employment.
      </blockquote>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
